<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>What food luxurious loads the board</l><l>When, at His table, sits the Lord!</l><l>The wine how rich, the bread how sweet,</l><l>When Jesus deigns the guests to meet!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If now, with eyes defiled and dim,</l><l>We see the signs, but see not Him;</l><l>Oh, may His love the scales displace,</l><l>And bid us see Him face to face!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thou glorious Bridegroom of our hearts,</l><l>Thy present smile Thy grace imparts!</l><l>Oh, lift the veil, if veil there be,</l><l>Let every saint Thy glory see!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
